## 2.6 Table: `audit_logs`

### Description

Stores an immutable record of important user and system actions.

### Columns

```text
id                  BIGINT UNSIGNED PRIMARY KEY AUTO_INCREMENT
user_id             BIGINT UNSIGNED NULL
store_id            BIGINT UNSIGNED NULL
