```

### Constraints and indexes

```text
UNIQUE(store_id, code)
UNIQUE(device_uuid)
INDEX(store_id, is_active)
INDEX(last_seen_at)
```

---

## 3.6 Table: `document_sequences`

### Description

Generates sequential document numbers safely for each store and document type.

### Columns

```text
id                  BIGINT UNSIGNED PRIMARY KEY AUTO_INCREMENT
store_id            BIGINT UNSIGNED NOT NULL
document_type       VARCHAR(30) NOT NULL
prefix              VARCHAR(20) NULL
next_number         BIGINT UNSIGNED NOT NULL DEFAULT 1
padding             TINYINT UNSIGNED NOT NULL DEFAULT 6
reset_period        VARCHAR(20) NULL
last_reset_at       TIMESTAMP NULL
created_at          TIMESTAMP NULL
updated_at          TIMESTAMP NULL
```

### Relationships

```text
store_id -> stores.id
```

### Constraints

```text
UNIQUE(store_id, document_type)
```

### Possible document types

```text
sale
quotation
return
stock_transfer
stock_count
purchase_order
goods_receipt
cash_shift
```

### Business rules

Generate numbers inside a database transaction using:

```php
lockForUpdate()
```

Do not generate sequential document numbers using:

```text
COUNT(*)
MAX(number) + 1
```

