# 4. Departments and Product Categories Module

## Module description

This module organizes products using departments and nested product categories.

Departments belong to the business and may be managed by a responsible user.

Categories may optionally belong to a department and may have parent categories.

---

## 4.1 Table: `departments`

### Description

Stores high-level business departments.

### Columns

```text
id                      BIGINT UNSIGNED PRIMARY KEY AUTO_INCREMENT
business_id             BIGINT UNSIGNED NOT NULL
responsible_user_id     BIGINT UNSIGNED NULL
code                    VARCHAR(30) NOT NULL
name                    VARCHAR(80) NOT NULL
description             VARCHAR(255) NULL
phone                   VARCHAR(20) NULL
email                   VARCHAR(254) NULL
is_active               BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT TRUE
created_at              TIMESTAMP NULL
updated_at              TIMESTAMP NULL
deleted_at              TIMESTAMP NULL
```

### Relationships

```text
business_id -> businesses.id
responsible_user_id -> users.id
```

### Constraints and indexes

```text
UNIQUE(business_id, code)
UNIQUE(business_id, name)
INDEX(responsible_user_id)
INDEX(business_id, is_active)
```

---

## 4.2 Table: `product_categories`

### Description

Stores configurable product categories with optional hierarchical nesting.

### Columns

```text
id                  BIGINT UNSIGNED PRIMARY KEY AUTO_INCREMENT
business_id         BIGINT UNSIGNED NOT NULL
department_id       BIGINT UNSIGNED NULL
parent_id           BIGINT UNSIGNED NULL
code                VARCHAR(30) NOT NULL
name                VARCHAR(80) NOT NULL
description         VARCHAR(255) NULL
is_active           BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT TRUE
created_at          TIMESTAMP NULL
updated_at          TIMESTAMP NULL
deleted_at          TIMESTAMP NULL
```

### Relationships

```text
business_id -> businesses.id
department_id -> departments.id
parent_id -> product_categories.id
```

### Constraints and indexes

```text
UNIQUE(business_id, code)
INDEX(business_id, department_id)
INDEX(parent_id)
INDEX(business_id, name)
INDEX(business_id, is_active)
```

### Business rules

* A category cannot be its own parent.
* Recursive category loops must be prevented in the application.
* A category and its department must belong to the same business.

