# 7. Products Module

## Module description

This module manages the shared product catalog.

Products may be:

* Standard products
* Bulk products
* Kits
* Services

Products may be sold using different measurement units.

Inventory must not be stored directly in the `products` table because stock belongs to a store.

Product prices must not be stored directly in `products` because a product may have multiple prices and store-specific pricing.

---

