description                 TEXT NULL
product_type                VARCHAR(20) NOT NULL
allows_fractional_qty       BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT FALSE
sale_to_inventory_factor    DECIMAL(14,6) NOT NULL DEFAULT 1
net_content_quantity        DECIMAL(14,4) NULL
track_inventory             BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT TRUE
allow_negative_inventory    BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT FALSE
target_margin_percent       DECIMAL(7,4) NULL
is_active                   BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT TRUE
created_by_user_id          BIGINT UNSIGNED NULL
updated_by_user_id          BIGINT UNSIGNED NULL
created_at                  TIMESTAMP NULL
updated_at                  TIMESTAMP NULL
deleted_at                  TIMESTAMP NULL
```

### Relationships

```text
business_id -> businesses.id
department_id -> departments.id
category_id -> product_categories.id
inventory_unit_id -> measurement_units.id
sale_unit_id -> measurement_units.id
net_content_unit_id -> measurement_units.id
created_by_user_id -> users.id
updated_by_user_id -> users.id
```

### Allowed product types

```text
standard
bulk
kit
service
```

### Constraints and indexes

```text
UNIQUE(business_id, sku)
INDEX(business_id, name)
INDEX(department_id, category_id)
INDEX(business_id, is_active)
INDEX(product_type)
```

### Business rules

Do not include these fields in `products`:

```text
current_quantity
minimum_quantity
maximum_quantity
cost_price
sale_price
discount
margin
barcode
image
```

Those values belong in normalized related tables.

Calculate actual margin dynamically:

```text
gross_margin_amount = unit_price - unit_cost

gross_margin_percent =
    ((unit_price - unit_cost) / unit_price) * 100
```

Store `target_margin_percent` only when it represents a configured target.

